  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-09-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第9题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-09",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23联考）某商品的利润率是20%。如果进货价降低20%，售价保持不变，此时利润率是多少？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "40%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "30%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "60%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "50%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          88
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          82
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-09-p088.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第82页",
            "pdfPage": 88
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把原进价设100元，利润率20%，售价120元。进价降低20%后变80元，售价仍120，利润为40元。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "新利润率＝40/80＝50%，选D。分母也变了，不能把原利润率与降价幅度直接相加。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "利润率永远按当前成本作分母，成本变动后要重新计算。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
