    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-10-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第10题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-10",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（21江苏）超市销售某种水果，第一天按原价售出总量的60%，第二天原价打八折售出剩下的一半，第三天按成本价全部售出。若销售全部该水果的利润率为34%，则该水果按原价销售的利润率为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "68%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "51%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "50%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "36%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          88
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          82
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-10-p088.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷10 · 讲义第82页",
            "pdfPage": 88
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-10-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-10",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把总量设为1，单位成本C、原价P。三天分别卖出60%、20%、20%，对应收入0.6P、0.2×0.8P、0.2C，总收入0.76P＋0.2C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总利润率34%，所以总收入应为1.34C，得到0.76P＋0.2C＝1.34C，即P＝1.5C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "原价销售利润率＝(P－C)/C＝50%，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "剩余的一半要换算成总量的比例，成本价售出部分收入仍需计入。"
        }
      ],
